1. what is Data Hiding?
   Data hiding means restricting direct access to a class's internal data by declaring fields as private and providing
   controlled access through methods such as getters and setters
   Ex:-
   class Employee {
    private String name;
    private double salary;

    public String getName() {
        return name;
    }

    public void setName(String name) {
        this.name = name;
    }
   }

